## Basic Request Queries

### 1. All Requests (Last 24 Hours)
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| project timestamp, name, url, resultCode, duration, 
    customDimensions.HttpMethod, customDimensions.RequestPath,
    customDimensions.CorrelationId, customDimensions.ClientIpAddress
| order by timestamp desc
```

### 2. Requests by HTTP Method
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend HttpMethod = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod)
| summarize RequestCount = count() by HttpMethod
| order by RequestCount desc
```

### 3. Requests by Endpoint/Path
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| summarize 
    RequestCount = count(),
    AvgDuration = avg(duration),
    MaxDuration = max(duration),
    MinDuration = min(duration)
    by RequestPath
| order by RequestCount desc
```

### 4. Recent Requests with Full Details
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(1h)
| project timestamp, 
    Method = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    StatusCode = resultCode,
    Duration = duration,
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId),
    TraceId = tostring(customDimensions.TraceId),
    ClientIP = tostring(customDimensions.ClientIpAddress),
    UserAgent = tostring(customDimensions.UserAgent),
    Controller = tostring(customDimensions.Controller),
    Action = tostring(customDimensions.Action)
| order by timestamp desc
| take 100
```

