## Exception Analysis

### 5. All Exceptions (Last 24 Hours)
```kql
exceptions
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| project timestamp, 
    ExceptionType = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionType),
    ExceptionMessage = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionMessage),
    RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    RequestMethod = tostring(customDimensions.RequestMethod),
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId),
    LineNumber = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionLineNumber),
    FileName = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionFileName),
    StackTrace = tostring(customDimensions.StackTrace)
| order by timestamp desc
```

### 6. Exception Count by Type
```kql
exceptions
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend ExceptionType = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionType)
| summarize ExceptionCount = count() by ExceptionType
| order by ExceptionCount desc
```

### 7. Exceptions with Line Numbers and File Names
```kql
exceptions
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
