### 9. Exceptions by Request Path
```kql
exceptions
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| summarize ExceptionCount = count() by RequestPath
| order by ExceptionCount desc
```

### 10. Aggregate Exceptions (Multiple Inner Exceptions)
```kql
exceptions
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where isnotempty(customDimensions.AggregateInnerExceptions)
| project timestamp,
