## Performance Monitoring

### 11. Average Response Time by Endpoint
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| extend TotalDurationMs = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs)
| summarize 
    RequestCount = count(),
    AvgDuration = avg(TotalDurationMs),
    P50Duration = percentile(TotalDurationMs, 50),
    P95Duration = percentile(TotalDurationMs, 95),
    P99Duration = percentile(TotalDurationMs, 99),
    MaxDuration = max(TotalDurationMs)
    by RequestPath
| order by AvgDuration desc
```

### 12. Slow Requests (Over 1 Second)
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend TotalDurationMs = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs)
| where TotalDurationMs > 1000
| project timestamp,
    Method = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    Duration = TotalDurationMs,
    StatusCode = resultCode,
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
| order by Duration desc
```

### 13. Response Time Breakdown
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend 
    TotalDuration = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs),
    ResponseDuration = todouble(customDimensions.ResponseDurationMs),
    TimeBetweenRequestAndResponse = todouble(customDimensions.TimeBetweenRequestAndResponseMs)
| project timestamp,
    RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    TotalDuration,
    ResponseDuration,
    TimeBetweenRequestAndResponse,
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
| order by TotalDuration desc
| take 50
```

### 14. Performance Trends (Hourly)
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| extend TotalDurationMs = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs)
| summarize 
    AvgDuration = avg(TotalDurationMs),
    P95Duration = percentile(TotalDurationMs, 95),
    RequestCount = count()
    by bin(timestamp, 1h)
| order by timestamp asc
| render timechart
```

### 15. Requests by Duration Ranges
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend TotalDurationMs = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs)
| extend DurationCategory = case(
    TotalDurationMs < 100, "Fast (<100ms)",
    TotalDurationMs < 500, "Normal (100-500ms)",
    TotalDurationMs < 1000, "Slow (500ms-1s)",
    TotalDurationMs < 5000, "Very Slow (1s-5s)",
    "Extremely Slow (>5s)")
| summarize RequestCount = count() by DurationCategory
| order by RequestCount desc
```

