## Audit & User Identity

### 16. Requests by Authenticated Users
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where tostring(customDimensions.IsAuthenticated) == "True"
| project timestamp,
    UserName = tostring(customDimensions.UserName),
    UserId = tostring(customDimensions.UserId),
    UserEmail = tostring(customDimensions.UserEmail),
    TenantId = tostring(customDimensions.TenantId),
    RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    HttpMethod = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    StatusCode = resultCode,
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
| order by timestamp desc
```

### 17. User Activity Summary
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where isnotempty(customDimensions.UserId)
| extend UserId = tostring(customDimensions.UserId)
| summarize 
    RequestCount = count(),
    UniqueEndpoints = dcount(tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)),
    LastActivity = max(timestamp)
    by UserId
| order by RequestCount desc
```

### 18. Requests by User Roles
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where isnotempty(customDimensions.UserRoles)
| extend UserRoles = tostring(customDimensions.UserRoles)
| extend UserId = tostring(customDimensions.UserId)
| project timestamp, UserId, UserRoles, 
    RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    HttpMethod = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod)
| order by timestamp desc
```

### 19. Tenant-Based Activity
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where isnotempty(customDimensions.TenantId)
| extend TenantId = tostring(customDimensions.TenantId)
| summarize 
    RequestCount = count(),
    UniqueUsers = dcount(tostring(customDimensions.UserId)),
    UniqueEndpoints = dcount(tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath))
    by TenantId
| order by RequestCount desc
```

### 20. User Claims Analysis
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where isnotempty(customDimensions.UserClaims)
| project timestamp,
    UserId = tostring(customDimensions.UserId),
    UserClaims = tostring(customDimensions.UserClaims),
    RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| order by timestamp desc
| take 50
```

### 21. Unauthenticated Requests
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where tostring(customDimensions.IsAuthenticated) == "False" 
    or isnull(customDimensions.IsAuthenticated)
| summarize RequestCount = count() 
    by RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| order by RequestCount desc
```

