## Error Analysis

### 22. Failed Requests (4xx and 5xx)
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where resultCode >= 400
| project timestamp,
    Method = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    StatusCode = resultCode,
    Duration = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs),
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId),
    ClientIP = tostring(customDimensions.ClientIpAddress)
| order by timestamp desc
```

### 23. Error Rate by Endpoint
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| extend IsError = resultCode >= 400
| summarize 
    TotalRequests = count(),
    ErrorCount = sum(iff(IsError, 1, 0)),
    ErrorRate = (sum(iff(IsError, 1, 0)) * 100.0) / count()
    by RequestPath
| where ErrorCount > 0
| order by ErrorRate desc
```

### 24. Error Status Code Distribution
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where resultCode >= 400
| summarize ErrorCount = count() by resultCode
| order by ErrorCount desc
```

### 25. Errors with Request Details
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where resultCode >= 400
| project timestamp,
    Method = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    StatusCode = resultCode,
    QueryString = tostring(customDimensions.RequestQueryString),
    RequestBody = tostring(customDimensions.RequestBody),
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId),
    UserId = tostring(customDimensions.UserId)
| order by timestamp desc
```

### 26. 500 Internal Server Errors
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where resultCode == 500
| project timestamp,
    Method = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId),
    ClientIP = tostring(customDimensions.ClientIpAddress),
    UserAgent = tostring(customDimensions.UserAgent)
| order by timestamp desc
```

