## Correlation ID Tracking

### 27. Track Request by Correlation ID
```kql
let correlationId = "YOUR_CORRELATION_ID_HERE";
requests
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| where tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId) == correlationId
| project timestamp,
    Method = tostring(customDimensions.HttpMethod),
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    StatusCode = resultCode,
    Duration = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs),
    TraceId = tostring(customDimensions.TraceId)
| order by timestamp asc
```

### 28. All Telemetry for a Correlation ID (Requests + Exceptions)
```kql
let correlationId = "YOUR_CORRELATION_ID_HERE";
union
    (requests | where tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId) == correlationId),
    (exceptions | where tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId) == correlationId)
| project timestamp,
    Type = iff(itemType == "request", "Request", "Exception"),
    Name = coalesce(name, type),
    Details = coalesce(
        strcat("Path: ", tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath), " | Status: ", tostring(resultCode)),
        strcat("Exception: ", tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionMessage))
    )
| order by timestamp asc
```

### 29. Correlation ID Usage Statistics
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| where isnotempty(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
| extend CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
| summarize RequestCount = count() by CorrelationId
| where RequestCount > 1
| order by RequestCount desc
| take 20
```

