## Advanced Analytics

### 47. Request Flow Analysis (End-to-End)
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend 
    TotalDuration = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs),
    ResponseDuration = todouble(customDimensions.ResponseDurationMs),
    TimeBetweenRequestAndResponse = todouble(customDimensions.TimeBetweenRequestAndResponseMs)
| project timestamp,
    Path = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
    TotalDuration,
    ResponseDuration,
    TimeBetweenRequestAndResponse,
    ProcessingTime = TotalDuration - ResponseDuration - TimeBetweenRequestAndResponse,
    CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
| order by TotalDuration desc
| take 50
```

### 48. Peak Usage Times
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| extend HourOfDay = datetime_part("hour", timestamp)
| summarize RequestCount = count() by HourOfDay
| order by HourOfDay asc
| render columnchart
```

### 49. Endpoint Health Score
```kql
requests
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
| extend RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath)
| extend 
    IsSuccess = resultCode < 400,
    IsFast = todouble(customDimensions.TotalDurationMs) < 500
| summarize 
    TotalRequests = count(),
    SuccessRate = (sum(iff(IsSuccess, 1, 0)) * 100.0) / count(),
    FastResponseRate = (sum(iff(IsFast, 1, 0)) * 100.0) / count(),
    HealthScore = ((sum(iff(IsSuccess, 1, 0)) * 100.0) / count()) * 0.7 + 
                  ((sum(iff(IsFast, 1, 0)) * 100.0) / count()) * 0.3
    by RequestPath
| where TotalRequests > 10
| order by HealthScore asc
```

### 50. Exception-to-Request Correlation
```kql
let exceptionsWithRequests = 
    exceptions
    | where timestamp > ago(24h)
    | extend CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
    | join kind=inner (
        requests
        | where timestamp > ago(24h)
        | extend CorrelationId = tostring(customDimensions.CorrelationId)
    ) on CorrelationId
    | project 
        ExceptionTime = timestamp,
        ExceptionType = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionType),
        ExceptionMessage = tostring(customDimensions.ExceptionMessage),
        RequestPath = tostring(customDimensions.RequestPath),
        RequestMethod = tostring(customDimensions.RequestMethod),
        RequestStatusCode = resultCode,
        CorrelationId
    | order by ExceptionTime desc;
exceptionsWithRequests
```

