## Quick Reference: Custom Dimensions

The following custom dimensions are available in Application Insights:

### Request Properties
- `HttpMethod` - HTTP method (GET, POST, etc.)
- `RequestPath` - Request path/endpoint
- `RequestQueryString` - Query string (sensitive data masked)
- `RequestQueryParameters` - JSON of query parameters
- `RequestRouteParameters` - JSON of route parameters
- `RequestFormData` - JSON of form data
- `RequestHeaders` - JSON of request headers (if enabled)
- `RequestImportantHeaders` - Important headers only
- `RequestBody` - Request body content (if enabled and within size limit)
- `RequestScheme` - HTTP scheme (http/https)
- `RequestHost` - Host name
- `RequestProtocol` - HTTP protocol version
- `RequestContentType` - Content type
- `RequestContentLength` - Content length
- `RequestTimestamp` - Request timestamp
- `ResponseStatusCode` - HTTP status code
- `ResponseContentType` - Response content type
- `ResponseContentLength` - Response content length
- `ResponseHeaders` - JSON of response headers (if enabled)
- `ResponseImportantHeaders` - Important headers only
- `TotalDurationMs` - Total request duration in milliseconds
- `ResponseDurationMs` - Response generation duration
- `TimeBetweenRequestAndResponseMs` - Time between request and response start
- `RequestStartTime` - Request start timestamp
- `ResponseStartTime` - Response start timestamp
- `ResponseEndTime` - Response end timestamp

### User Identity Properties (if enabled)
- `IsAuthenticated` - Boolean string
- `AuthenticationType` - Authentication type
- `UserName` - Username
- `UserId` - User ID from claims
